WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.788
Let's get A9 Voice on your PC.

2
00:00:02.828 --> 00:00:04.250
It takes about a minute.

3
00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:09.619
On a9voice.com, click Download
from the Microsoft Store.

4
00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:12.302
The Store opens right to A9 Voice.

5
00:00:12.342 --> 00:00:14.429
Click the blue button to install it.

6
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:18.131
No warnings, nothing to approve,

7
00:00:18.171 --> 00:00:20.429
and Windows keeps it up to date for you.

8
00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:23.291
Open A9 Voice.

9
00:00:23.331 --> 00:00:27.852
The first time, pick the free
speech model that runs on your PC.

10
00:00:27.892 --> 00:00:29.135
It downloads once.

11
00:00:36.533 --> 00:00:39.065
Now click into anything you type in.

12
00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.923
An email, a chat, your AI.

13
00:00:40.963 --> 00:00:43.638
Hold Control and Space, and just talk.

14
00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:47.384
Let go, and it's typed.

15
00:00:47.424 --> 00:00:48.206
That's it.

16
00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:54.209
Next up: your first meeting,
with no bot in the call.
